 "subject": "clade label with one tip",
 "messages_listed": 5,
 "last_activity": "2017-01-04T16:59:20Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "4PUWtOwvFQAJ",
   "from": "Paul Hoekstra",
   "author": "2440aab9c066ba65",
   "date": "2017-01-04T09:53:46Z",
   "subject": "clade label with one tip",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would like to put clade labels on my tree, however one of the clades consist of just 1 specimen.<div><br></div><div>For example, when using the following tree:</div><div><div>set.seed(1)</div><div>tr &lt;- rtree(4)</div><div><br></div><div><div>Then to assign tips 2 to 4 to clade A and tip 1 to clade B I tried this:</div></div><div><br></div><div>p &lt;- ggtree(tr) + geom_cladelabel(node=6, label = &quot;A&quot;, barsize = 2)<br></div><div>p + geom_cladelabel(node=1, label = &quot;B&quot;)</div></div><div><br></div><div>But then I get the warning that the input node is a tip and clade B isn&#39;t displayed. I would like to see a black square for clade B, so I also tried geom_point2, but in that function &#39;offset&#39; and &#39;hjust&#39; don&#39;t work. </div><div><br></div><div>How could I resolve this?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance,</div><div>Paul</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "6SpbonYzFQAJ",
   "from": "Yu, Guangchuang",
   "author": "cec41188340e8212",
   "date": "2017-01-04T10:58:37Z",
   "subject": "Re: clade label with one tip",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Of course, <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">node=1</code> is a tip and it throw warning as expected.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">You can label that tip with a label ‘B’, using the following code:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">p + geom_tiplab(aes(subset=(node==<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>), label=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;B&quot;</span>))\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48ZGl2Pk9mIGNvdXJzZSwgYG5vZGU9MWAgaXMgYSB0aXAgYW5kIGl0IHRocm93IHdhcm5p\r\nbmcgYXMgZXhwZWN0ZWQuPGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj5Zb3UgY2FuIGxhYmVsIHRoYXQgdGlwIHdpdGgg\r\nYSBsYWJlbCAnQicsIHVzaW5nIHRoZSBmb2xsb3dpbmcgY29kZTo8YnI+PGJyPjwvZGl2PmBgYHI8\r\nYnI+PGRpdj5wICsgZ2VvbV90aXBsYWIoYWVzKHN1YnNldD0obm9kZT09MSksIGxhYmVsPSJCIikp\r\nPGJyPmBgYDxicj48YnI+PC9kaXY+\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
